            <title>[MAHOUT-1138] Clean up some findbugs warnings</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1138</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Several of the high priority warnings are due to classes such as IntPairWritable that advertise Serializable, but which are coded incorrectly (and never used that way).&lt;/p&gt;

